# L §5.3 moves, §8.3 LOAD-MOVES `moves <V>: unknown, or not known before this version` (tally 2.1.6, issue #88):
# `moves v_act[a1]` names no version, its reference printed as written. tally 2.1.5's refcore printed its parse
# node (moves index(obj=name(id='v_act'), …)).
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"

input age3: int
band rate(a: int): money PLN
def r[m in months]: money PLN = rate(age3)
ask q: r[2027-05]

version v_act
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2026-12-01
  age3 = 3 "the age"
  rate: [0, 6) = 400.00 PLN "under 6"
  rate: [6, 18) = 250.00 PLN "6 to 17"

version v2
  cite act
  governs always
  known 2027-05-01
  moves v_act[a1] to 2027..
=== expect
refused: LOAD-MOVES moves v_act[a1]: unknown, or not known before this version (m.tally:23)
